# Rumahkita Design System

**Source of truth:** `docs/design.md` — read it before building or changing UI.

## Tokens (use these, don't invent colors/fonts)

- **Colors:** `context.themeColors` from `lib/theme/app_colors.dart` (`AppColors`)
- **Typography:** `context.themeText` from `lib/theme/app_text_styles.dart` (`AppTextTheme` — Fredoka headings, Nunito body)
- **Spacing & radii:** `context.themeSpacing` from `lib/theme/app_spacing.dart` (`AppSizeTheme` — card radius ≥ 16px)
- **Theme wiring:** extend via `lib/theme/app_theme.dart`; do not use `ColorScheme.fromSeed` or ad-hoc palettes in widgets

## Personality

- **Nurturing companion** — warm, honest, never scolding. Reflect home health; don't assign blame.
- **Micro-copy:** communal and gentle (e.g. "This chore needs a little love" not "Task Overdue").
- **Layout:** soft, organic, spacious. Generous rounded corners; fluid transitions. No sharp corporate dashboards.

## Color semantics

| Token | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| Cozy Linen | Backgrounds |
| Sprout Green | Success, approval, thriving |
| Sunny Butter | Active/draft, inline deltas |
| Drooping Leaf Brown | Caution/rejection — **never harsh red** |

Map semantic states to `success`, `active`, `caution` — not `Colors.red` / `Colors.blue`.

## UX patterns (see design.md for full detail)

- **Offline:** normal, not an error. Solo-house metaphor; tucked-away seed → unfurl on sync.
- **Guardian role:** helper duty, not manager. Subtle pet accessory; passive roster portrait.
- **Ceremony:** silent reset, Sunny Butter inline deltas — no loud alerts.
- **Eviction/removal:** strict neutrality — no pet graphics, gamified copy, or emotional animations. Audit-ledger tone only.

## Don't

- Hardcoded hex colors, `Theme.of(context).colorScheme` seed colors, or generic Material defaults in presentation code
- Harsh alert reds, neon accents, or clinical data-dashboard styling
- Blaming or punitive copy for sync failures, overdue tasks, or score drops
